{"page":163,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:96","surah":7,"ayah":96,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَوْ أَنَّ أَهْلَ ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ ءَامَنُوا۟ وَٱتَّقَوْا۟ لَفَتَحْنَا عَلَيْهِم بَرَكَـٰتٍ مِّنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَلَـٰكِن كَذَّبُوا۟ فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَكْسِبُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If the people of those towns had believed and been mindful of God, We would have showered them with blessings from the heavens and earth, but they rejected the truth and so We punished them for their misdeeds.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَوْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"walaw","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَهْلَ","en_gloss":"people","transliteration":"ahla","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْقُرَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"(of) the cities","transliteration":"l-qurā","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"(had) believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱتَّقَوْا۟","en_gloss":"and feared Allah","transliteration":"wa-ittaqaw","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لَفَتَحْنَا","en_gloss":"surely We (would have) opened","transliteration":"lafataḥnā","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَلَيْهِم","en_gloss":"upon them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَرَكَـٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"blessings","transliteration":"barakātin","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the heaven","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِن","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākin","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَذَّبُوا۟","en_gloss":"they denied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"7:96"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"So We seized them","transliteration":"fa-akhadhnāhum","verse_key